					"uidString" : "qVs52KpcQte5IEwX914JGg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### System Interface\n{{gtClass:TheHub}} is a starting point for *Tactical-Tools* to connect into the rest of the system at a macro level. It doubles as a *meta interface* defined between these tools and the underlying system that can be adapted to other Smalltalk environments [Pharo](https://pharo.org),  [Squeak](https://squeak.org)  or [Cuis](https://cuis.st) should the code ever be ported elsewhere. We call this interface \"TheWall\"."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-07-31T06:51:12.408354+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-06T04:08:56.866783+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "lTDpcgl+QMWfVHnj8JNLQg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### Higher level isolation/compatibility\nMethods fulfilling this role can be marked with pragma <<ttWall>>. Notice how any method in the system can be marked, implying that this will be available in all Smalltalks in which Tactical-Tools loads."
			},
			{
